WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.104
Install the .NET SDK: Install the dot net S D K from dotnet.microsoft.com slash download. Get the latest S D K, run the installer, then finish.

2
00:00:10.454 --> 00:00:17.654
Verify with the terminal: Open a terminal and run dotnet dash dash version. A number like 8 point 0 means you are ready.

3
00:00:18.004 --> 00:00:25.780
Editor + C# tools: Install Cursor or Visual Studio Code, add the C sharp Dev Kit extension, and open the csharp-beginner-workbook folder.

4
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:35.466
Create and run a console app: Create a console app with dotnet new console, move into the folder, and run dotnet run. Edit Program.cs to make it yours.

5
00:00:35.816 --> 00:00:45.296
C# tips: Remember: C sharp is the language and dot net is the toolbox. Open the whole project folder, finish Module 1, then take the quiz.
